If you're seeing a lot of archons then you're probably either too high
level or you're taking too long.  I see an archon during my ascension
run about 1 in 5 times (or maybe even less).  However, I also don't do
any* fighting on Earth, Air, Fire, or Water (any* =3D I kill Rodney, the
minotaur and sometimes the elven king on earth but usually with a wand
of death or a rubber chicken, and I will melee my way out of a vortex
on air; otherwise I only zap) and usually ascend below XL 20.
Although a low XL does not necessarilly prevent the generation of
archons it does seem to help me, but YMMV.

If you see an archon zap it with a wand of teleportation once it is on
an orthogonal or diagonal.  Sometimes it takes more than one zap to
get them truly away.  Unfortunately they sometimes appear while
levitating across the Plane of Fire so be careful and be sure to have
an escape plan.

